==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|gebūwede|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|gibūidi|lang=goh}}. Literally meaning ''das Gebaute'' "that has been built".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ɡəˈbɔʏ̯də]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Gebäude.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Gebäudes|Gebäude}} 

# [[building]], [[edifice]], [[structure]]

